## 🚀 Quickstart

Ensure you have [Astral `uv`](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/) and [`just`](https://github.com/casey/just) installed.

```bash
# Install recommended AI agent skills
just setup-skills

# Conformance check with Farama Gymnasium API
just test-env

# Baseline policy evaluation
just eval

# Train RL agent
just train

# Interactive human play via Raylib
just play

# Run all test suites across packages
just test

# Check formatting and linting
just check
```

