## 🏗️ Architecture: Monorepo Workspace

This repository adheres to `skills/gymnasium-env/references/structure.md`, splitting the simulation environment from RL algorithms and evaluation:

- `packages/env` (`{{ package_name }}-env`):
  - `core/physics.py`: Headless deterministic physics transitions with `__slots__`.
  - `env/gym_env.py`: Farama Gymnasium `Env` subclass (`reset`, `step`, `render`, `close`).
  - `env/reward.py`: Pure bounded reward shaping functions.
  - `engine/renderer.py`: Raylib visual rendering using `import pyray as pr` for human observation mode.
  - `cli.py`: Google Fire CLI (`play`, `test_env`).
- `packages/agents` (`{{ package_name }}-agents`):
  - `agent/`: Protocol definitions, Random and Heuristic baseline policies.
  - `eval/`: Multi-seed evaluation runner producing statistical reports (`mean`, `std`, `success_rate`).
  - `training/`: Training loops and hyperparameter sweep harnesses.
  - `cli.py`: Fire CLI (`eval`, `train`).

AI agents working in this repository should refer to [`AGENTS.md`](file:///home/romuald/Projects/Perso/Skills/AGENTS.md) for architectural rules and Farama Gymnasium standards.
